{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/2は、ツインテールの日なんですね☺︎\nお見苦しいですが、ツインしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/02/4535992/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に幼くなるな〜(> <)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールは恥ずかしいけど...\nたまにはね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/02/4535992/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャッタースピードを1番早くして\n水の流れを切り取った一枚。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水ってこんな風になってるんだ〜と\n改めて観察、感動できる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青っぽい雰囲気が大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/02/4535992/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にシャッタースピードを遅くして\n光を操った写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/4にしたから、4秒間で\nゆっくりカメラを♡型に動かして\n自分で♡にしたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけ色んな光があると\n楽しいねー◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真私凄い好き。\n見てるだけで幸せな気持ちになれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでクイズ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2枚目の光の♡の写真は、\nどこで撮ったでしょうか✩？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ヒント\nチームDが大好きなあの場所の、\nあの幻想的な場所。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ムーンソング」【Alexandros】さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくて高い声が曲の\n透き通る雰囲気を存分に醸し出していて\n本当素敵な声だなー\n英語と日本語の歌詞のクロスも\n聞いていて心地いい。\n\"光の無いこの世界で\n僕はどれくらい見えるの？\n次が浮かんだその場所へ\nツキを頼らずに向かおう\"\nこの歌詞が凄い好き。\n前へ進む勇気が湧く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/02/4535992/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の愛未とちま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/02/4535992/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかよし☺︎☺︎\nにんまり☺︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}